{"ticker":"ACGL","updated":"2026-11-13T22:33:19Z","profile":{"longName":"Arch Capital Group Ltd.","shortName":"Arch Capital Group Ltd.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Diversified","country":"Bermuda","website":"https://www.archgroup.com","fullTimeEmployees":8000,"marketCap":35680833536,"trailingPE":8.962388,"forwardPE":10.9834385,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.9001403,"pegRatio":1.05,"targetMeanPrice":113.57895,"targetHighPrice":140.0,"targetLowPrice":97.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.089,"earningsGrowth":-0.157,"grossMargins":0.3764,"operatingMargins":0.27096,"profitMargins":0.23309,"totalRevenue":18777999360,"beta":0.194,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":113.63,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":87.05,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Arch Capital Group Ltd., together with its subsidiaries, provides insurance, reinsurance, and mortgage insurance products in the United States, Canada, Bermuda, the United Kingdom, Europe, and Australia. The company operates through three segments: Insurance, Reinsurance, and Mortgage. The Insurance segment offers commercial automobile; commercial multiperil; financial and professional line liability; admitted, excess, and surplus casualty lines; property and short-tail specialty; workers compensation; and casualty insurance. Its Reinsurance segment provides reinsurance products for casualty; marine and aviation; property catastrophe; property excluding property catastrophe; and other specialty products. The Mortgage segment offers U.S. primary mortgage insurance business written predominantly on loans sold to the Federal National Mortgage Association and Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corporation; reinsurance and underwriting services related to the U.S. credit-risk transfer business and other U.S. mortgage reinsurance transactions; and international mortgage insurance and reinsurance business covering loans. It markets its products through a group of licensed independent retail and wholesale brokers. The company was formerly known as Risk Capital Holdings, Inc. Arch Capital Group Ltd. was founded in 1995 and is headquartered in Pembroke, Bermuda.","summary_zh":"Arch Capital Group Ltd. 及其子公司在美國、加拿大、百慕達、英國、歐洲和澳洲提供保險、再保險和抵押貸款保險產品。該公司透過三個部門運作：保險部門、再保險部門和抵押貸款部門。保險部門提供者用汽車；商業多重風險；財務和專業責任；承認、超額和剩餘傷亡限額；房地產和短尾專業；工人賠償；和傷亡保險。其再保險部門為傷亡人員提供再保險產品；航海和航空；財產災難；財產（不包括財產災難）；及其他特色產品。抵押貸款部門提供美國初級抵押貸款保險業務，主要針對出售給聯邦國家抵押貸款協會和聯邦住房貸款抵押公司的貸款；與美國信用風險轉移業務和其他美國抵押貸款再保險交易相關的再保險和承保服務；以及涵蓋貸款的國際抵押貸款保險和再保險業務。它透過一組獲得許可的獨立零售和批發經紀人來行銷其產品。該公司前身為 Risk Capital Holdings, Inc.。 Arch Capital Group Ltd. 成立於 1995 年，總部位於百慕達彭布羅克。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險 - 多元化","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":91.99,"h":92.21,"l":89.7,"c":89.86,"v":1767000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":88.96,"h":89.23,"l":87.2,"c":87.38,"v":2710500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":87.31,"h":88.03,"l":87.11,"c":87.35,"v":2533500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":87.04,"h":88.76,"l":87.01,"c":88.19,"v":2249800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":88.85,"h":89.01,"l":88.27,"c":88.4,"v":4190200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":88.34,"h":88.78,"l":87.77,"c":88.03,"v":3034900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":88.03,"h":88.65,"l":87.58,"c":88.46,"v":2210300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":88.47,"h":90.86,"l":88.21,"c":90.76,"v":2825900},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":91.0,"h":91.58,"l":88.77,"c":89.57,"v":2230400},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":90.0,"h":91.05,"l":89.7,"c":90.88,"v":1444400},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":90.87,"h":90.87,"l":89.26,"c":89.83,"v":1242600},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":89.82,"h":90.94,"l":89.51,"c":90.73,"v":1724800},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":90.24,"h":91.06,"l":89.79,"c":90.31,"v":1446900},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":89.64,"h":90.42,"l":88.77,"c":89.08,"v":1460300},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":88.85,"h":91.53,"l":88.83,"c":90.79,"v":1801400},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":91.03,"h":92.06,"l":90.86,"c":91.35,"v":1474500},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":91.65,"h":94.11,"l":91.65,"c":94.1,"v":2143800},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":94.67,"h":94.81,"l":92.83,"c":93.1,"v":1651600},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":93.